<h1>Practice KPIs</h1>

<p class="subtitle">The FinOps practice measured against the FinOps Framework's published targets:
allocation accuracy (tag target &ge;90%), the 20/15/12% forecast-variance maturity ladder,
effective savings rate, and anomaly spend-share bands (green &lt;2% / yellow 2-7% / red &gt;7%).
Every number is deterministic and carries its qid.</p>


